  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Changing laws, changing lives in Official Development Assistance eligible countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Changing laws, changing lives in Official Development Assistance eligible countries is a component of Changing Laws, Changing Lives - Reducing violence and discrimination against LGBT people, women and girls, and other vulnerable groups through the reform of sexual offences, anti-discrimination and hate crime laws in the Commonwealth and beyond. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;382,600. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Democratic participation and civil society, Human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
